                <pb facs="0107" n="15" xml:id="pg15"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Aaron Kenig to the
                            Legation.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Wein Tan</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_imprecise-inferred-from-date-rules" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1898-05-31T23:59:59+01:00"
                            notBefore="1898-05-01T00:00:00+01:00" when="1898-05"
                        >5/98</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: Fater Please hav sorey with me with I
                    cent stent I em widout sent 16 Days it is to blem me but I did not meant to du
                    watt it is not wrigt. Please push dis case I hav sien the answer from Zlocrow,
                    Please ansver dem at ones I did expect to sell mine watch or to pawn it, but I
                    cant git inof to git away to Bremen, I am asking you es you should bee mone on
                    Fater to helpp me in thies case, I hopp you will not for get yours very
                    trouly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Kenig.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
